      hu: ["Dubai központjától kb. 115 km-re keletre fekszik.", "A Hatta-erőd eredetileg 1896-ban épült.", "A víztározó gátja kb. 6 millió gallon víz befogadására képes.", "Több mint 30 km-nyi kijelölt hegyi kerékpárúttal rendelkezik.", "A Hatta Wadi Hub kalandközpont 2018-ban nyílt meg.", "A régió átlagos tengerszint feletti magassága 330 méter."],
      ro: ["Situat la aproximativ 115 km est de centrul Dubaiului.", "Fortul Hatta a fost construit inițial în anul 1896.", "Barajul are o capacitate de aproximativ 6 milioane de galoane.", "Găzduiește peste 30 km de trasee dedicate ciclismului montan.", "Hatta Wadi Hub a fost deschis ca centru de aventură în 2018.", "Regiunea se află la o altitudine medie de 330 de metri."],
      en: ["Located about 115 km east of Dubai city center.", "The Hatta Fort was originally constructed in 1896.", "The dam has a capacity of approximately 6 million gallons.", "Features over 30 km of dedicated mountain bike trails.", "Hatta Wadi Hub was opened as an adventure center in 2018.", "The region sits at an average elevation of 330 meters."],
